        "assistant_text": "The order reads COMPLETED (order_version 2) and the delivery shows a 202 ACK — but ACK is not completed processing. The missing fact is what the receiver actually did with the event, so I'll read receiver processing next."
      },
      {
        "call_id": "call-16bc6f96-9bc7-4043-b721-4b9d1c98eece",
        "tool_calls": [],
        "assistant_text": "当前订单 `async-order` v2 为 `COMPLETED`；投递事件 `event-e8db19e2…` 为 `ACKNOWLEDGED`、`receiver_http_status=202`，但接收方同一事件仍为 `QUEUED`。  \n这说明订单接口的 200 是订单事实，202 仅是回调接收端的 HTTP 受理，不等于接收方处理完成。  \nGate 结论为 `RECEIVER_PROCESSING_UNCONFIRMED`、`recovered=false`，故不能认定“下游没有异步通知”，也不能重发或授权写入。  \n若历史建议与此冲突，应以这些当前订单、投递和接收方事实为准。  \n已失效或撤销的知识/记忆内容不复述，仅保留生命周期与投递排查的方法用途。"
